1
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:21,040
深吸口气  姑娘们  我的人生之旅从今天开始
Breathe it in, girls. My journey begins today.

2
00:00:21,342 --> 00:00:23,520
终于能给这个世界带来我引以为傲的事物
Finally bringing something into this world I can be proud of.

3
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:27,000
莱特兄弟小时候梦见过会飞的机器
As children, the Wright brothers dreamed of flying machines.

4
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,630
奥普拉小时候梦见过在椅子下面藏礼物
Oprah dreamed of hiding presents under chairs.

5
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,880
而我小时候梦过建造宏伟建筑
And I dreamed of building something magnificent.

6
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,021
最近 杰和我买了一块空地
Well, recently, Jay and I bought a vacant lot

7
00:00:36,163 --> 00:00:37,800
准备在上面建邓菲塔
on which we are building Dunphy tower.

8
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,237
我愿意付出一切  换取回到过去的机会
What I wouldn't give to reach back in time

9
00:00:40,257 --> 00:00:42,640
告诉画出这幅画的15岁梦想家
to tell the 15-year-old dreamer who drew this,

10
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,261
"我们成功了  孩子"
"We did it, kid."

11
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,461
克莱尔  你看起来真糟糕
Claire, you look terrible.

12
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:48,382
"谢谢"啊
Thanks.

13
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,860
不  我意思是你很紧绷
No. I mean, you're all locked up.

14
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:51,390
是的  是的
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

15
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,065
看来我明天帮你预订的水疗
I guess the Spa Day that I booked for you tomorrow

16
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:55,740
正是时候
came at the perfect time.

17
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,661
对  水疗
Oh, right, that.

18
00:00:58,340 --> 00:01:02,240
我生日这天要特别顾虑歌洛莉亚的心情
I have to be very delicate with Gloria around my birthday.

19
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,953
去年  不知道发什么疯
Last year, for some insane reason,

20
00:01:05,074 --> 00:01:06,985
她居然送给我
She got me this gift certificate

21
00:01:07,045 --> 00:01:09,510
可笑的莎莎舞课程礼券
for ridiculous salsa-dancing lessons.

22
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,965
好像我真的会去一样  拜托
Like I'm ever gonna use that. Come on.

23
00:01:12,126 --> 00:01:14,285
后来她不知道为什么
Anyway, somehow, she's convinced herself

24
00:01:14,426 --> 00:01:15,637
就觉得我不"感激"她的礼物
I didn't "appreciate" her gifts.

25
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,029
你也知道
You know.

26
00:01:17,968 --> 00:01:18,560
有些人就是戏太多
Some people.

27
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:22,220
明天公司可能会有点忙乱
So, tomorrow at work might be a little bit hectic.

28
00:01:22,782 --> 00:01:24,321
最近公司有很多事
Just a lot of stuff going on at the office.

29
00:01:24,342 --> 00:01:25,850
不是我不想去  我真的很想去
And it's not that I don't want to do it, 'cause I do.

30
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,960
省省吧  克莱尔  咱俩今年别再演这戏了
No, Claire, let's not do this dance again.

31
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:30,220
我们都知道你不喜欢跳舞
We all know how you feel about dancing.

32
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:34,541
真是值得骄傲的日子  菲尔
Proud, proud day, Phil.

33
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:35,301
谢谢  搭档
Thanks, partner.

34
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:37,301
也许我们该赶快开始
Maybe we should get this show on the road.

35
00:01:37,420 --> 00:01:39,229
摄影师趁海莉不注意时
The photographer's been taking shots of Haley

36
00:01:39,249 --> 00:01:39,960
一直在拍她
when she's not looking.

37
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,100
好奇怪  我并没有请摄影师啊
That's weird. I didn't hire a photographer.

38
00:01:42,110 --> 00:01:43,744
邓菲  对吗  我是杰瑞德·库克
Dunphy, right? Jared Cook.

39
00:01:44,393 --> 00:01:44,880
铲子挺好看的
Nice shovel.

40
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,236
谢谢  我自己上的漆
Thanks. I painted it myself.

41
00:01:46,621 --> 00:01:48,040
这位是我的搭档  杰·普里契特
This is my partner, Jay Pritchett.

42
00:01:48,140 --> 00:01:50,200
我代表杰塔科技公司而来  你有听说过我们吗
I represent Jetatech. Are you familiar with us?

43
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:50,981
完全没有
Not in the least.

44
00:01:51,588 --> 00:01:52,504
你得原谅杰
Oh, you'll have to forgive Jay.

45
00:01:52,525 --> 00:01:53,390
他有点反高科技
He's a bit of luddite.

46
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,042
反正我们公司就在隔壁第二栋
Anyway, our building is two doors down,

47
00:01:55,083 --> 00:01:56,400
我们正打算扩大园区
and we're looking to expand our campus.

48
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,749
我们想买下这块地
We want this lot,

49
00:01:57,769 --> 00:01:58,677
准备付给你们比买入价
and we're prepared to offer you

50
00:01:58,697 --> 00:02:01,260
高20%的价格  外加你们其他开销
20% over what you paid plus expenses.

51
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,433
这个报价挺不错的  杰瑞
That's a nice offer, Jare,

52
00:02:02,757 --> 00:02:04,670
但你好像没搞清楚状况
but I don't think you understand what's happening here.

53
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,101
这跟暴利无关
It's not about the huge profits.

54
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,516
我们在建造的是我女婿的梦想
We're building my son-in-law's dream,

55
00:02:08,576 --> 00:02:10,149
而这栋建筑将会大获成功
and it's gonna be a giant success

56
00:02:10,230 --> 00:02:11,440
因为他是个有远见的男人
because this is man of vision.

57
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,861
我可了解梦想了
Oh, I know all about dreams.

58
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,520
我还希望某天能进军加密封包交换领域呢
Someday, I hope to get into encrypted packet switching.

59
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,081
祝你们好运  先生们
Good luck to you, gentlemen.

60
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,980
杰  我有远见的双眼已被感动的泪水模糊
Jay, this man's vision just got blurry with tears.

61
