你能不能控制一下你自己
Would you get ahold of yourself.

62
00:02:21,994 --> 00:02:23,840
我刚说的那些鬼话都是为了抬高价格
I just said that crap to drive the price up.

63
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:24,534
他会回来的
He'll be back.

64
00:02:24,636 --> 00:02:25,601
我不想要他回来
I don't want him to come back.

65
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:27,421
不管你刚说的是不是真心话  这真是我的梦想
Whether you meant it or not, this is my dream.

66
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,847
我们做这件事是为了赚钱
We're in this to make money.

67
00:02:28,868 --> 00:02:29,500
我们会赚到的
And we will.

68
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:35,150
根据商业规划委员会赋予我的权力
By the power vested in me by the commercial zoning board,

69
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:37,517
我宣布正式破土动工
I do hereby officially break ground

70
00:02:37,638 --> 00:02:40,357
未来要在这建起邓菲塔
on the future home of Dunphy tower.

71
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:44,094
这土还真硬
Oh, that's...strong soil.

72
00:02:44,982 --> 00:02:45,587
这是个好兆头
That's a good omen.

73
