77
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,140
跟他们说以后再也没有加班费已经很糟了
Telling them there's no more overtime was bad,

78
00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:14,080
但当我告诉他们以后再也不提供贝果了
but when I had to tell them there were no more bagels,

79
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:15,670
有人用杯子扔我的头呢
someone threw a cup at my head.

80
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,480
我不知道还能做什么
I don't know what else to do.

81
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,895
我们圣诞期间的销售额
Sales-wise we didn't exactly have

82
