84
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,713
我就随便提议一下
Well, just spitballing here --

85
00:03:23,773 --> 00:03:26,060
也许我们可以炒掉仓库的肯尼
Maybe we could fire Kenny from the warehouse.

86
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,041
没有要炒掉任何人
No one's getting fired.

87
