可是他常丑化模仿我
But he does a really hurtful impression of me.

88
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,716
来吧  各位  都围过来
come on, guys. Everybody gather round.

89
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,470
我跟你们一样不喜欢预算缩减的决定
I don't like these budget cuts any more than you do,

90
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,820
但我希望你们知道  我跟你们一条心
But I want you to know I'm in this with you.

91
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:37,337
我已经削减了我的开销
I've cut my expenses.

92
00:03:37,357 --> 00:03:39,180
主管出差搭飞机都只坐经济舱
All the execs are flying coach.

93
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:41,680
但我想要你们觉得自己也有发声权
But I do want you to feel like you have a voice in this.

94
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:45,250
所以  我办公室的门不仅随时为你们开著
So, not only is my office door always open to you,

95
00:03:45,260 --> 00:03:46,960
我甚至直接叫人把它给拆了
I've actually had it removed.

96
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,181
没有门所代表的意义很有震慑力  老板
That's a very powerful metaphor, boss.

97
00:03:49,484 --> 00:03:51,000
没有门所代表的意义很有震慑力  老板
That's a very powerful metaphor, boss.

98
00:03:52,060 --> 00:03:54,441
肯尼  谢谢你让气氛保持轻松
Kenny, thanks for keeping it light.

99
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:56,841
太棒了
So good.

100
00:03:58,340 --> 00:03:59,161
生日快乐
Happy birthday!

101
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,801
你来这里干什么
What are you doing in here?

102
00:04:00,860 --> 00:04:01,915
你说你太忙了
You said that you were too busy

103
00:04:01,935 --> 00:04:03,740
没时间离开办公室去庆祝生日
to get away from the office to celebrate.

104
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:05,880
所以我把庆祝仪式带来公司
So I brought the celebration to you.

105
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,423
犀利
Snap.

106
00:04:07,322 --> 00:04:08,524
-那是鱼子酱吗  -没错
- Is that caviar? - Yes!

107
00:04:09,293 --> 00:04:11,740
还有美酒相配
And something to wash it down.

108
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:13,940
香槟耶
Oh, yay, champagne.

109
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,820
快给我搞扇门来
Get me a door.

110
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:20,450
如果你给我搭的这东西在科学展览不能获奖
If I don't win the science fair with this thing you built me,

111
00:04:20,460 --> 00:04:21,121
比赛肯定有黑幕
It's rigged.

112
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,281
说得好  姐们
Amen, sister.

113
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,640
拜托  你们怎么不等我就开始了
Oh, come on, you started without me?

114
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,061
不  我们不等你就完工了
No, we finished without you.

115
