因为那里可以改良
Because right there, you can make it better

118
00:04:31,790 --> 00:04:32,370
只要加一个...
If you just added --

119
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:32,663
好吧
Okay.

120
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,393
就那里
So, right there,

121
00:04:34,413 --> 00:04:35,950
那里可以改良  只要加一个...
You can make it better if you just added --

122
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,301
你不是说你们已经完工了吗
Okay, I thought you said you were done!

123
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:40,200
米奇尔  我爱你
Okay, Mitchell, I love you.

124
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,571
但是呢
But...?

125
00:04:41,581 --> 00:04:44,030
没有"但是"
No "But."

126
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:48,180
可是我们都知道我才是更技术型的爹
Yet we both know I'm the more mechanically-inclined daddy.

127
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:49,301
我的手也很巧的
I'm handy.

128
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,860
不知道这话能不能安慰到你
If it makes you feel any better,

129
00:04:51,145 --> 00:04:52,120
我也一点没搭手
I didn't do anything, either.

130
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,740
不  没有安慰到我
No, that doesn't make me feel better.

131
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:55,301
你本该从这个过程中学习的
You're supposed to be learning from this.

132
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,621
我新学了一句脏话
I learned a new swear word.

133
00:04:57,100 --> 00:05:00,080
我手被木刺扎了嘛  不过也值了
Uh, um, I got a splinter. It was worth it.

134
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:00,962
看著
Watch.

135
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,041
这就完了吗
Is that it?

136
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,480
我太不懂  因为我不是技术型的爹
I'm confused 'cause I'm not mechanically inclined.

137
00:05:13,242 --> 00:05:13,450
您真幽默
Hardy-har-har.

138
00:05:13,513 --> 00:05:16,660
没完  我只要稍作调整
No, I just need to make a little adjustment.

139
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:17,564
小心
