求求你告诉我这是挖到石油了
Please tell me that's oil.

146
00:05:30,684 --> 00:05:33,021
挖到了一段横穿过这块地的下水道
Found a sewer line running straight through the property.

147
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,266
还有总水管
Also, a water main,

148
00:05:34,286 --> 00:05:36,561
不知道为什么  还有大量甲烷
And for some reason, giant pockets of methane.

149
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:37,659
快和我说说  皮特
Talk to me, Pete.

150
00:05:37,679 --> 00:05:38,820
我觉得我刚已经说了啊
I feel like I just did.

151
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:40,181
处理费要多少
How much is it gonna cost?

152
