钱的话  少说得六位数
Money-wise, you're looking at mid-six-figures.

153
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:45,600
你说的六位数包括小数点后两位吗
When you say six, does that include the two-cent figures?

154
00:05:45,860 --> 00:05:46,282
不包括
No.

155
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:49,750
另外  时间上可能要耽误一年
Plus, time-wise, you're looking at maybe a year delay

156
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:51,810
来申请水电许可  环境许可
with permits and utilities, environmental --

157
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:52,961
别跟我说了  皮特
Stop talking to me, Pete.

158
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:55,001
我的天  杰怎么来了
Oh, my God, why is Jay here?

159
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:56,161
我也给他打电话了
I called him, too.

160
00:05:56,405 --> 00:05:58,160
如果他看到这些会叫停整个工程的
He'll shut this whole project down if he sees this.

161
00:05:58,265 --> 00:05:59,261
找点胶合板把洞盖住
Put some plywood over the hole.

162
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,280
托尼  想办法盖住甲烷的气味
Tony, do what you can to cover the methane smell.

163
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:02,501
其他人  都装忙
Everybody else, just look busy.

164
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:03,800
怎么会这样
How could this happen?

165
00:06:03,820 --> 00:06:05,481
今天有只瓢虫落在我肩头  还以为是吉兆
I had a ladybug land on my shoulder today.

166
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:11,001
遇到什么问题了
What's the problem?

167
00:06:11,243 --> 00:06:12,247
问题是我饿了
Problem is I'm hungry.

168
00:06:12,309 --> 00:06:14,611
解决方法是  走几步就能到小印度吃饭
The solution -- we're walking distance to Little India.

169
00:06:14,652 --> 00:06:15,802
-我们走吧  -那是什么味道
- Shall we? - What's that smell?

170
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,375
嘘  那是皮特的体臭
Shh, that's -- that's Pete.

171
00:06:17,395 --> 00:06:19,442
他对这事特别敏感  千万别提
He's, uh, very sensitive about it. Don't bring it up.

172
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,354
既然你来了
While I got you,

173
00:06:20,704 --> 00:06:22,811
我想在这装个自行车架你说怎么样
I was thinking about putting in a bike rack over here.

174
00:06:22,821 --> 00:06:25,496
-那是怎么回事  -我什么都没看见
- What the hell is that? - I didn't see anything.

175
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:27,515
