我给你5分钟
You got five.

532
00:18:15,667 --> 00:18:17,001
女士  这工作已经很不容易了
Ma'am, this job is hard enough.

533
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,740
有个小问题
Uh, hey, so, small problem.

534
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:21,850
可以等
It can wait!

535
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,960
没有等不了的问题
Every problem can wait.

536
00:18:24,140 --> 00:18:25,541
一边凉快去吧  这位先生
So now go, mister.

537
00:18:25,580 --> 00:18:27,400
你不是吧  我都去过你家了
Come on, I've been in your home.

538
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:29,021
说吧  本  是什么事
All right, Ben. What is it?

539
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:30,233
今天是玛格丽特的生日
Today's Margaret's birthday... Uh-huh.

540
00:18:30,274 --> 00:18:32,600
但是当时已经来不及取消蛋糕
...but it was too late to cancel the cake.

541
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:34,080
大家都看到蛋糕送来了
Everyone saw it get delivered.

542
00:18:34,090 --> 00:18:35,361
没事  那就让他们吃蛋糕吧
It's fine. Let them eat cake.

543
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,021
什么  她是不是在开玩笑
What? Is she kidding?

544
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:38,841
我不是这个意思
That's not what I meant!

545
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,241
克莱尔  深呼吸
Claire, breathe.

546
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:41,072
不要  才不要
No, no!

547
00:18:41,297 --> 00:18:42,320
歌洛莉亚  够了
Gloria, we're done.

548
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:45,000
别冲我嚷嚷  我只是想哄你开心
Don't scream at me. I just wanted to make you happy.

549
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:46,702
而我也是在哄你开心
And I'm just trying to make you happy

550
00:18:46,743 --> 00:18:48,010
因为你对别人喜不喜欢
because you're so damn sensitive

551
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,830
你的生日礼物这件事超级玻璃心
about me not liking your birthday presents.

552
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:52,840
而我今天最最不需要的就是这个
Come on, this is the last thing I needed today.

553
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:57,121
天啊  快看她的手
Oh, my God. Look at her hands.

554
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,801
她就在这里面做指甲吗
She's just been in here getting a manicure.

555
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,961
你的良心不痛吗
How do you sleep?

556
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:00,681
拿下她
Get her!

557
00:19:00,691 --> 00:19:01,622
冷静点  乔茜
Whoa, whoa, back it up, Josie.

558
00:19:01,632 --> 00:19:02,920
没有人要拿下她
Nobody's gonna get her.

559
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:06,173
我知道这场面看起来有点糟糕
I realize that the optics are a bit troubling,

560
00:19:06,213 --> 00:19:06,860
尤其是在今天
Especially today.

561
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:08,430
一个你在里面喝著香槟
A day when you've been sipping champagne

562
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:10,580
而我们在外面超过一小时吃不到零食的一天
while we've gone over an hour without snacks.

563
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:11,262
够了
Enough!

564
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:13,940
你们这帮人真该觉得自己丢脸
You should all be ashamed of yourselves.

565
00:19:14,140 --> 00:19:15,570
我都认识你们多久了
How long have I known you people?

566
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:17,849
多明  肯尼  乔茜
Dom, Kenny, Josie,

567
00:19:17,889 --> 00:19:19,283
-两个赫姆  -你不是吧
- The two Herms. - Seriously?

568
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,220
你们所有人5点准时下班  而她从来不下班
You all go home at 5:00. This woman never punches out.

569
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,430
她回了家也很少睡觉
She goes home and never sleeps

570
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:27,000
因为她不停在想怎么让公司更好
because she's thinking how to make this company better.

571
00:19:27,583 --> 00:19:30,220
你们看不出来她人都要废了吗
Can't you tell what a mess she has become?

572
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:33,141
看她有多神经紧绷  还开始抽抽
How tense she is, her awkward tics,

573
00:19:33,220 --> 00:19:36,280
压力大磨牙都要把牙磨没了
The way she grinds her teeth to dust.

574
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:38,820
我觉得她应该被宠爱照顾一下
I think that she deserves some pampering.

575
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:40,760
你们都快滚出去吧
So now get out of here!

576
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:41,382
走吧  走吧
Let's go. Come on.

577
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:43,051
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

578
00:19:43,061 --> 00:19:44,581
对不起啦
I am sorry.

579
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,880
我今年真的想做好送你礼物的事
I just wanted to make it right this year.

580
00:19:46,940 --> 00:19:49,361
有的  你真的做到了
Oh, you did. You really did.

581
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,350
那就好  现在回去坐好
Okay, good. So go back and sit down

582
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:54,040
因为抱你就像抱个衣帽架似地
Because hugging you is like hugging a coat rack.

583
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:55,402
好了
Okay.

584
00:19:56,260 --> 00:19:57,781
很好
Oh, that's good.

585
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:00,381
对不起
I'm sorry.

586
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:02,241
我做了力所不能及的大梦
I dreamt too big.

587
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:03,001
这不是你的错
It's not your fault.

588
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:05,380
是我自己相信了你
I'm the one who believed in you.

589
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,460
也是你抬价把我们抬到太平间
You're also the one who overplayed his hand.

590
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:10,350
我们已经知道我们都犯了错误
We've already established mistakes were made.

591
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:12,360
现在该想想接下来该怎么走
We need to be thinking about next steps.

592
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,570
或许我们该盖个小一点的项目
Maybe we need to build something smaller,

593
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:16,290
比如一个很酷的小餐厅之类的
Like a cool restaurant or something.

594
00:20:16,300 --> 00:20:18,380
我也想过  但谁会来这里吃啊
I've thought about that. Who's gonna come down here?

595
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:20,101
这里都没地方停车
There's nowhere to park.

596
00:20:21,080 --> 00:20:23,561
天啊  就是这个了  停车场
Oh, my God, that's it -- a parking lot.

597
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:25,461
这主意还不错
That's not bad.

598
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:27,384
盖这个都不要什么成本
We could build it for nothing

599
00:20:27,424 --> 00:20:29,321
而且很快就能把贷款给还上
and pay off the majority of the loan by tomorrow.

600
00:20:29,540 --> 00:20:31,560
咱们还是换个地儿聊吧
Let's talk about this somewhere else.

601
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:34,320
或许15岁的菲尔的计划并没有错
Maybe 15-year-old Phil had it right.

602
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:36,310
有时候你只需要把你的梦想
Sometimes you have to look at your dream

603
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:37,301
换个角度看
from a different angle.

604
00:20:39,180 --> 00:20:42,320
或许梦想一直都是个停车场
I guess it was a parking lot all along.

605
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,102
求你告诉我是晚餐做好了
Please tell me that's dinner.

606
00:20:46,164 --> 00:20:48,001
-我要饿死了  -不  是大爸的闹钟
- I'm starving. - No, that's daddy's alarm.

607
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,570
因为脑震荡  我们不能让他
We can't let him nap for more than two hours

608
00:20:49,580 --> 00:20:50,621
小睡超过两小时
because of the concussion.

609
00:20:51,580 --> 00:20:53,280
看他睡的样子  多么平静安宁
Oh, look at him. He looks so peaceful.

610
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,901
他今天太辛苦了
He's had such a rough day.

611
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:57,180
我上次试著叫醒他的时候  他超不开心
When I tried to wake him up last time, he got so upset.

612
00:20:57,380 --> 00:20:58,041
我来吧
I'll do it.

613
00:20:58,340 --> 00:20:59,656
谁教你的啊
Who raised you?

614
00:20:59,676 --> 00:21:01,640
好吧  温柔点啊
Fine, just be gentle, okay?

615
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:02,188
谢谢惠顾
Thanks.

616
00:21:02,556 --> 00:21:03,700
还有  别碰这个
Also, don't touch this.

617
00:21:03,780 --> 00:21:04,850
这是我的美术作业
It's my art project.

618
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:07,438
-我能帮忙你一起弄吗  -不能
- Oh, can I help you with that? - No.

619
00:21:07,459 --> 00:21:09,621
大爸说应该他来帮  因为他比你有美术细胞
Daddy said he should because he's more artistic than you.

620
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:10,422
拿来
Okay.

621
00:21:13,060 --> 00:21:14,273
怎么了  怎么了  咋啦
What?! What?! Why?!

622
00:21:15,090 --> 00:21:15,941
太好了你还活著
So good you're alive
